# Website Beyond Assistant (Mbole AI)

When working on the public website chat widget or website channel:

## Do

- Reuse Beyond Assistant (`BeyondAssistantService`, tools, memory, rental ERP, quotation, leads, handover, call requests).
- Treat Website as a **transport/channel** on the same conversation tables (`channel=website`).
- Keep AI keys and WaSender credentials **server-side only**; browser posts to Laravel only.
- Respect conversation `mode`: when HUMAN, AI must send zero replies (re-check before send).
- Use `LeadCatalog::SOURCE_WEBSITE` for website-originated leads.
- Prefer clarification over premature human handover (`assistant_max_clarifications` / `WEBSITE_AI_MAX_CLARIFICATIONS`).
- Never invent ERP prices, stock, availability, or quotation numbers — tools only.

## Do not

- Build a separate website chatbot with duplicated business logic.
- Call OpenAI/Wasender from browser JavaScript.
- Hand over after a single misunderstood message without clarification.
- Claim a call was placed when only a call request was opened.

## Architecture

Visitor → Mbole AI widget → Website chat API → Beyond Assistant → ERP tools → Hub inbox (same as WhatsApp).
